# Directories search tools must not read.
#
# This repo has no .git yet, and ripgrep only honours .gitignore inside a git
# repository - so every grep was walking build output and the Hypothesis cache.
# One .hypothesis constants file is a single 40-line JSON array of every string
# literal in the solver, and it matched almost any domain search, entering
# context for nothing.
#
# .ignore is honoured with or without git. Keep it in sync with .gitignore.

.next/
.tools/
coverage/
dist/
node_modules/
out/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/
graphify-out/cache/
.venv/
venv/

# Not a directory, but a downloaded CA is a large base64 blob that matches almost any search.
*.crt
